<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρό-κρῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chosen before others,
				select,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				537d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				945b
			</span></i>: esp. of a <i>preliminary</i> list of <i>selected</i>
			candidates, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληρωτοὶ ἐκ προκρίτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1298b9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>, Decr.ib.<i><span class="en">
				30.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἢ . .</span>
			<i>chosen rather</i> than . . , <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.257
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			at Rome, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.,</span>
			=
			<i>princeps,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				57.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς γερουσίας,</span>
			=
			<i>princeps senatus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				53.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				46.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς νεότητος,</span>
			=
			<i>princeps juventutis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				78.17
			</span></i> (also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς ἱππάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					71.35
				</span></i>
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν γραμματοφόρων</span>), =
			<i>princeps peregrinorum,</i> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				78.14
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόκοιτος</span> codd.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
